        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hemp lime concrete, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hemp lime concrete, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 64e926e8-dd48-3704-b902-daaf546087c4
Market dataset representing the supply of hemp lime concrete in Switzerland. The market share of ARBIO was estimated to 60% by Gaëlle Talandier. The remaining 40% are produced in Switzerland and charged with a 10% addition for non-declaration of information.; Geography: Switzerland
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Modern technology
Time period: 2010 and after
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from dedicated company. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_64e926e8-dd48-3704-b902-daaf546087c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
